 "remarks": "NEW CONSTRUCTION NEAR COMPLETION IN THE COVETED HUNT CLUB NEIGHBORHOOD BY THE MOST SOUGHT-AFTER LUXURY BUILDER, MATTERA CONSTRUCTION, celebrated for creating architecturally significant & stunning modern homes that blend timeless elegance, exceptional craftsmanship & bespoke interiors. A Mattera home is a masterpiece with state-of-the-art amenities, breathtaking design & uncompromising structural integrity. This impeccably designed 6-bedroom residence offers sophisticated interiors & seamless indoor-outdoor living across four finished levels, perfectly sited on a quiet, private cul-de-sac. The light filled main level showcases an open floor plan with a two-story foyer, a custom kitchen and breakfast area, family room with fireplace, private office, living room, dining room, mudroom & two powder rooms. Upstairs, the luxurious primary suite is a true retreat with a spa-inspired bath, expansive dressing areas, 2 walk-in closets plus 4 additional ensuite bedrooms & a spacious laundry room. The walkout lower level provides a recreation/family room, gym, 6th bedroom & a full bath. The finished third floor offers flexible space for a playroom, office, media room plus a half bath. The resort-style backyard includes a heated Gunite pool and spa, expansive stone patio, outdoor kitchen and beautifully landscaped grounds. Offering a rare opportunity to own an exceptional Mattera home of enduring quality & the highest level of craftsmanship, consistently creating lifelong admirers",
